    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\frac{10}{24}=\\frac{5}{12}$",
      "worked": "There are $6\\times4=24$ equally likely outcomes. For die results $1,2,3,4,5,6$, the numbers of spinner results giving a score of at least $7$ are $0,0,1,2,3,4$ respectively.\n$$\\begin{align*}N(\\text{score}\\ge7)&=1+2+3+4\\\\&=10\\\\P(\\text{score}\\ge7)&=\\frac{10}{24}\\\\&=\\frac{5}{12}\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
